#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-msi-installer-and-group-policy-install.rst:234
msgid "macOS managed configuration (MDM)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-msi-installer-and-group-policy-install.rst:236
msgid ""
"From Mattermost Desktop v6.2.0, admins can manage supported Desktop App "
"configuration on macOS using managed preferences delivered through an MDM"
" solution, in addition to the Windows group policy support described "
"above. macOS managed preferences support the same configuration items as "
"the Windows group policies listed in the `Install group policy files "
"locally <#install-group-policy-files-locally>`__ section, including "
"predefined server lists, server management controls, and update "
"notification controls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-msi-installer-and-group-policy-install.rst:238
msgid ""
"To apply managed configuration on macOS, deploy a configuration profile "
"that sets the supported keys to client Macs through your MDM solution. "
"The Mattermost Desktop App reads managed preference values on launch; "
"restart the app after changing managed configuration for new values to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""

